description: Never attribute commits to Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits: no Cursor attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Cursor Agent`, or `cursoragent@cursor.com` to a commit message, trailer, author, or committer.

If a hook or wrapper injects that trailer, strip it before the commit is pushed. Do not skip other hooks to do this.
